<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Treasury to detail OLO exchange auction.</title>
<headline>Belgian Treasury to detail OLO exchange auction.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury said on Tuesday it would announce OLO lines for the June 10 exchange auction after 1500 GMT on Wednesday, May 28. -- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
